{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your luck\u00a0in this mysterious roguelike deckbuilder. Defeat your boss... OR DIE!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5 Steps to Success</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip over the good cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't flip over the bad cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy Game Breaking Perks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid Termination!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based push-your-luck gameplay! Each turn, flip over a card and see if you get a reward or a punishment. Flip over too many punishments and you lose... how risky do you want to be?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game changing perks! Between rounds, visit Mr. Magpie's Shop and purchase from his selection of perks which change the rules of the game, and provide layered strategic goals. Build a package of perks with enough synergy to finally beat the house and leave this corporate nightmare realm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mr. Magpie! He loves you. Why would you ever want to leave?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspirations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mr. Magpie is lovingly inspired by Inscryption, Severance, Balatro and Party House.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3616280?t=1754492146","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3616280?t=1754492146","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616280/7c9a775d20d4aa1e8279c979561a45d2639718ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754492146","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616280/7c9a775d20d4aa1e8279c979561a45d2639718ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754492146","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game features implied mystery drug use / drug testing. During rounds of the card game, the player is implied to be hurt by the punishments the opponent inflicts upon you."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your luck\u00a0in this mysterious roguelike deckbuilder. Defeat your boss... OR DIE!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5 Steps to Success</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip over the good cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't flip over the bad cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy Game Breaking Perks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid Termination!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based push-your-luck gameplay! Each turn, flip over a card and see if you get a reward or a punishment. Flip over too many punishments and you lose... how risky do you want to be?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game changing perks! Between rounds, visit Mr. Magpie's Shop and purchase from his selection of perks which change the rules of the game, and provide layered strategic goals. Build a package of perks with enough synergy to finally beat the house and leave this corporate nightmare realm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mr. Magpie! He loves you. Why would you ever want to leave?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspirations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mr. Magpie is lovingly inspired by Inscryption, Severance, Balatro and Party House.</p>","developers":["Giant Light Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616280/929e871920721dc7a0d4095ff0b7e57cabcb142a/header.jpg?t=1754492146","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>R